### Phase 3 — Test Specs by Role

#### 3A. Visitor Role (`tests/e2e/visitor/`)

| Spec File | Test Cases | Edge Cases |
|---|---|---|
| `visitor-login.spec.ts` | Login with VISITOR role → redirects to `/visitor/home` | Invalid role fallback |
| `visitor-tna-request.spec.ts` | Request new TNA → verify PENDING state → mock gov approval → verify ACTIVE | Duplicate TNA request rejection |
| `visitor-search-bind.spec.ts` | Search marketplace → select address → initiate binding → verify pending state | No results state, empty search |
| `visitor-payment.spec.ts` | Checkout flow → Apple Pay mock → Visa mock → success toast → verify transaction | Payment failure (500), insufficient funds |
| `visitor-shipment.spec.ts` | View shipments table → filter by IN_TRANSIT → verify tracking details | Empty shipments state |
| `visitor-unbind.spec.ts` | Unbind active TNA → verify UNLINKED status | **⚠️ IN_TRANSIT guardrail**: attempt unbind while shipment is IN_TRANSIT → expect error toast "Cannot unlink: Active deliveries in progress" |
| `visitor-profile.spec.ts` | View/edit profile → update contact info → verify persistence | |

#### 3B. Owner Role (`tests/e2e/owner/`)

| Spec File | Test Cases | Edge Cases |
|---|---|---|
| `owner-login.spec.ts` | Login → redirect to `/owner/home` → verify wallet balance card | |
| `owner-properties.spec.ts` | Add property → verify in table → create sub-address → verify suffix code | Duplicate property, invalid building number |
| `owner-bindings.spec.ts` | View pending bindings → approve → verify balance increase → reject alternate | Auto-accept toggle verification |
| `owner-cashout.spec.ts` | Request wallet cash-out → select Apple Pay/Visa → verify payout record | Insufficient balance, payout failure |

#### 3C. Gov-User Role (`tests/e2e/gov/`)

| Spec File | Test Cases | Edge Cases |
|---|---|---|
| `gov-login.spec.ts` | Login → redirect to `/gov/home` → verify KPI dashboard | |
| `gov-tna-queue.spec.ts` | View pending queue → click review → navigate to detail | Empty queue state |
| `gov-tna-approval.spec.ts` | Open `req-pending-1` → approve → verify success animation → back to queue | Reject flow, 404 on invalid ID |
| `gov-address-queue.spec.ts` | View address queue → review `sub-001` → approve → verify decision state | |
| `gov-policy.spec.ts` | Toggle issuance mode MODERATED↔AUTONOMOUS → verify rule config persistence | |
| `gov-agencies.spec.ts` | View agencies table → verify permission display | |
| `gov-audit.spec.ts` | Verify audit log table renders with action history | |

#### 3D. Carrier-User Role (`tests/e2e/carrier/`)

| Spec File | Test Cases | Edge Cases |
|---|---|---|
| `carrier-login.spec.ts` | Login → redirect to `/carrier/home` → verify fleet dashboard | |
| `carrier-register.spec.ts` | Registration flow → webhook/API key redirection | Duplicate registration |
| `carrier-shipments.spec.ts` | View shipments → update status (CREATED→PICKED_UP→IN_TRANSIT→DELIVERED) | Invalid status transition |
| `carrier-driver.spec.ts` | Assign driver → verify task list → verify map page loads | |
| `carrier-resolve.spec.ts` | TNA-to-address resolution → verify physical address displayed | Invalid TNA code |

