## Critical Edge-Case Guardrails

| ID | Guardrail | Expected Behavior | Test File |
|---|---|---|---|
| G-1 | **In-Transit Unbind Block** | Attempting to unbind a TNA with `IN_TRANSIT` shipments → error toast with "Cannot unlink: Active deliveries in progress (409 Conflict)" | `visitor-unbind.spec.ts` |
| G-2 | **Payment Before Activation** | `activateBinding()` throws if no completed payment exists for binding | `visitor-payment.spec.ts` |
| G-3 | **Max TNA Limit** | Visitor with 3 active TNAs cannot request a 4th (when policy `max_active_tnas_per_visitor: 3`) | `visitor-tna-request.spec.ts` |
| G-4 | **Invalid TNA Resolution** | Carrier scanning an invalid/expired TNA code → error state | `carrier-resolve.spec.ts` |
| G-5 | **Gov 404 Detail Page** | Navigating to `/gov/tna-queue/nonexistent-id` → "Request not found" message | `gov-tna-approval.spec.ts` |
| G-6 | **Auto-Accept Toggle** | Owner toggles auto-accept ON → incoming binding bypasses manual approval | `owner-bindings.spec.ts` |
| G-7 | **Deprecated Route Redirect** | Navigating to `/gov/verification/queue` → 301 redirect to `/gov/tna-queue` | `smoke.spec.ts` |

